Short:    HD-Installer for Empire Strikes Back V1.2
Author:   Codetapper/Action (codetapper@hotmail.com), ICQ: 26051687
Uploader: Codetapper/Action (codetapper@hotmail.com)
Version:  1.2
Type:     game/patch

This patch applies to "Empire Strikes Back" (c) 1989 Vektor Grafix/Domark - 1 
disk. Supported versions: - Star Wars Trilogy (Jan Vieten)
                          - Original release (Christian Sauer)

REQUIREMENTS:
- Slave requires WHDLoad V10+ and RawDIC
- Game requires 512k chip mem (+450k other memory for preload option)

FEATURES: (27-May-2000)
- Full load from HD
- Saves high scores to disk
- Added a nice fade in and out effect for the title picture
- Added ButtonWait tooltype 
- MagicWB, RomIcon, NewIcon and OS3.5 Colour Icon (created by me!)

VERSION 1.2: (20-Mar-2003)
- Supports another version
- Added an OS3.5 box icon (great work by Christian!)
- Quit key changed to 'F10'

VERSION 2.0b: (27-Nov-2026) done by Vesuri
- Game speed fixed: no longer too fast on fast machines (as on an A500)
- Enhanced framerate (CUSTOM1, set in the installed icons): the waves drawn
  at up to 50 frames a second, interpolated, at the game's own speed
  (68020 or better, +88k other memory; slower machines draw as before)
- Lines, digits and colours no longer go wrong on fast CPUs
- Sound effects and the pause fade work on fast CPUs

Greetings to Jan and Christian for the originals, Christian again for the
superb icon, Wepl for WHDLoad, all Action members, my testing crew and the
WHDLoad team!


Codetapper/Action (20-Mar-2003)


